  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 182, 226);\">You've Got this Champ!</span></h2><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 182, 226); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Champ Allergy Toothpaste Affiliate&nbsp;Program</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(6, 130, 187); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Welcome to the Champ Allergy Toothpaste Affiliate Program! We are thrilled to partner with individuals who share our passion for promoting healthy smiles and allergy relief.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(6, 130, 187); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">There are over 100 million Americans that suffer from allergies and less than 5% have access to permanent allergy relief. Allergies are the top cause of missed school/work, asthma, eczema, and sinus/bronchial infections.&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(6, 130, 187);\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(6, 130, 187); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Most importantly we understand the impact of allergies to your family. Your kids don't want to go outside, dance, play soccer, or even get a pet. &nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(6, 130, 187);\"><br></span></p><span style=\"color: rgb(6, 130, 187);\"><br></span><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(6, 130, 187); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">We understand the daily struggles of allergy sufferers and the Mom's that are working, managing kids schedules, and in charge of the healthcare for their families. You, the working mom is the Champ.&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(6, 130, 187);\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(6, 130, 187); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">That's why we developed a specialized toothpaste that not only cleans teeth but also helps your body eliminate allergy symptoms permanently. Our unique formula helps with 84 different allergens including weeds, trees, grasses, dog, cat, and dust mites.</span></p><span style=\"color: rgb(6, 130, 187);\"><br></span><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(6, 130, 187); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">As an affiliate, you play a crucial role in bringing our innovative product to a wider audience. We offer competitive commissions, marketing materials, and dedicated support to help you succeed. By joining our program, you become part of a community committed to improving lives, one smile at a time.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(6, 130, 187); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">You can't do everything, but you can do this!</span></p></div></div>",
